{"frases": [{"a": 0, "b": 3.41, "t": "NASA lost a hundred-million-dollar spacecraft over one detail.", "k": ["hundred-million-dollar"], "w": [0.056, 0.337, 0.617, 0.736, 1.88, 2.484, 2.764, 2.991]}, {"a": 3.41, "b": 6.686, "t": "And that detail is something you learned in school.", "k": ["something"], "w": [3.46, 3.687, 3.968, 4.356, 4.529, 5.079, 5.306, 5.748, 5.921]}, {"a": 6.686, "b": 11.505999999999998, "t": "In December 1998, NASA launched a probe called Mars Climate Orbiter.", "k": ["1998,"], "w": [6.736, 6.918, 7.441, 8.282, 8.578, 9.1, 9.225, 9.578, 9.987, 10.283, 10.749]}, {"a": 11.505999999999998, "b": 14.626, "t": "Its job was to circle Mars and study its weather.", "k": ["weather."], "w": [11.556, 11.785, 12.014, 12.243, 12.418, 12.811, 13.094, 13.323, 13.662, 13.891]}, {"a": 14.626, "b": 16.641, "t": "It flew for more than nine months.", "k": ["months."], "w": [14.676, 14.851, 15.135, 15.364, 15.648, 15.932, 16.216]}, {"a": 16.641, "b": 18.375999999999998, "t": "Everything looked normal.", "k": ["Everything"], "w": [16.691, 17.302, 17.695]}, {"a": 18.375999999999998, "b": 19.953, "t": "In September 1999,", "k": ["1999,"], "w": [18.426, 18.605, 19.175]}, {"a": 19.953, "b": 24.006, "t": "it fired its engine to enter orbit and passed behind the planet.", "k": ["planet."], "w": [20.003, 20.182, 20.529, 20.763, 21.166, 21.345, 21.692, 22.038, 22.273, 22.676, 23.079, 23.313]}, {"a": 24.006, "b": 25.676, "t": "It never came back out.", "k": ["never"], "w": [24.056, 24.222, 24.544, 24.814, 25.084]}, {"a": 25.676, "b": 29.516, "t": "Now the detail you learned in school, the one nobody caught for months.", "k": ["learned"], "w": [25.726, 25.92, 26.114, 26.447, 26.641, 27.02, 27.168, 27.57, 27.764, 27.958, 28.291, 28.624, 28.818]}, {"a": 29.516, "b": 30.807, "t": "It wasn't the engine.", "k": ["engine."], "w": [29.566, 29.751, 30.11, 30.353]}, {"a": 30.807, "b": 33.256, "t": "And it wasn't the computer on board.", "k": ["computer"], "w": [30.857, 31.1, 31.285, 31.644, 31.887, 32.419, 32.604]}, {"a": 33.256, "b": 36.352000000000004, "t": "Two teams were sharing numbers about the thrusters.", "k": ["thrusters."], "w": [33.306, 33.546, 33.901, 34.199, 34.668, 35.137, 35.492, 35.732]}, {"a": 36.352000000000004, "b": 39.104000000000006, "t": "The contractor wrote them in pounds of force.", "k": ["pounds"], "w": [36.402, 36.642, 37.283, 37.638, 37.935, 38.119, 38.531, 38.714]}, {"a": 39.104000000000006, "b": 41.346000000000004, "t": "NASA's team read them as newtons.", "k": ["newtons."], "w": [39.154, 39.509, 39.807, 40.104, 40.402, 40.585]}, {"a": 41.346000000000004, "b": 44.431000000000004, "t": "One pound of force is about four and a half newtons.", "k": ["newtons."], "w": [41.396, 41.629, 41.972, 42.149, 42.493, 42.67, 43.013, 43.301, 43.534, 43.655, 43.943]}, {"a": 44.431000000000004, "b": 48.026, "t": "So every small correction was miscalculated by that much.", "k": ["miscalculated"], "w": [44.481, 44.658, 45.001, 45.345, 45.965, 46.197, 46.984, 47.161, 47.449]}, {"a": 48.026, "b": 50.066, "t": "After nine months of small errors,", "k": ["errors,"], "w": [48.076, 48.421, 48.71, 49.11, 49.288, 49.633]}, {"a": 50.066, "b": 53.402, "t": "the probe arrived far too low, deep in Mars's atmosphere.", "k": ["atmosphere."], "w": [50.116, 50.35, 50.695, 51.15, 51.384, 51.617, 51.934, 52.223, 52.401, 52.746]}, {"a": 53.402, "b": 55.476000000000006, "t": "It was never heard from again.", "k": ["again."], "w": [53.452, 53.63, 53.863, 54.208, 54.553, 54.842]}, {"a": 55.476000000000006, "b": 58.506, "t": "Lesson: never assume the other team means what you mean.", "k": ["Lesson:"], "w": [55.526, 55.965, 56.278, 56.642, 56.854, 57.167, 57.43, 57.743, 58.006, 58.218]}, {"a": 58.506, "b": 59.766000000000005, "t": "Check the units.", "k": ["units."], "w": [58.556, 58.869, 59.081]}, {"a": 59.766000000000005, "b": 62.468, "t": "Tell me if you still mix up miles and kilometers.", "k": ["kilometers."], "w": [59.816, 60.084, 60.248, 60.413, 60.629, 